  "job_B15.8.629_20260920_210346": {
    "text": "\u00d0is \u00fea land gem\u00e6ra De Tyrdebicgan tyrdebicgan.\n\u00c6rest of wi\u00f0ibroce in gates hoh.\nOf gates ho in sand w\u00e6llan, & of sand w\u00e6llan in deope w\u00e6llan.\nOf deope w\u00e6llan in heador, of heodore on \u00fea greata lindan.\nAnd of \u00fean greata lindan \u00fe\u00e6t in m\u00e6r b\u00e6c, of m\u00e6rb\u00e6ce in arwan stream.\nAnd of arwan in in m\u00e6r broc, of m\u00e6rbroce on cristel m\u00e6l ac.\nOf cristelm\u00e6lac in cloddes l\u00e6hge, of cloddes l\u00e6hge in cloddes w\u00e6llan.\nOf cloddes w\u00e6llan in \u00fea styfecinge, of \u00fe\u00e6re styfecingge in mersc hrycges hege.\nAnd \u00e6fter \u00feam hege in \u00fe\u00e6csic, & of \u00feam sice on ealhmundes byrigenne.\nAnd of \u00fe\u00e6re byrigene in \u00e6lfl\u00e6de brycge.\nOf \u00e6lfl\u00e6de brycge in to \u00fe\u00e6re ufere l\u00e6hge, & of ufere l\u00e6hge in martines m\u00e6dwe.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6dwe to bridene brycge, of britene brycge into hine gem\u00e6re to \u00feam holan broce.\nAnd swa andlang broces eft in wi\u00f0ibroc.",
